WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.803
- What is your favorite Disney movie?

00:00:02.803 --> 00:00:04.374
Well it's not here.

00:00:04.374 --> 00:00:05.485
Beauty and the Beast.

00:00:05.485 --> 00:00:07.210
No...this...

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:08.043
(crowd laughing)

00:00:08.043 --> 00:00:08.876
is bullshit.

00:00:08.876 --> 00:00:09.709
(crowd laughing)

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.377
This doesn't work.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.960
(upbeat music)

00:00:15.944 --> 00:00:19.687
- My favorite Disney movie
is The Little Mermaid.

00:00:19.687 --> 00:00:21.595
It came out when I was nine years old.

00:00:21.595 --> 00:00:24.438
A crab started singing
a Caribbean calypso tune

00:00:24.438 --> 00:00:25.615
and my life was never the same.

00:00:25.615 --> 00:00:29.538
- My favorite Disney character/princess/

00:00:29.538 --> 00:00:33.220
kickbutt heroine was Mulan.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.570
From a young age she
totally broke a gender norm

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.087
and I thought that was so cool.

00:00:38.087 --> 00:00:40.581
- My favorite Disney princess

00:00:40.581 --> 00:00:43.371
is um...Cinderella.

00:00:43.371 --> 00:00:44.769
- [Man] What do you
look for in a soulmate?

00:00:44.769 --> 00:00:46.510
- I like adventure.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:49.920
I'm also very, like, happy
and I don't like making plans

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.545
so you need to be adventurous

00:00:51.545 --> 00:00:53.534
if you wanna hang with me.

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:56.788
- I look for...humor.

00:00:56.788 --> 00:00:59.782
- I'm going to go with kindness.

00:00:59.782 --> 00:01:01.142
Everything else fades.

00:01:01.142 --> 00:01:02.950
- [Dwayne] Secretly,
you think your enemies

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.953
are envious of...?

00:01:04.953 --> 00:01:06.727
- I'm gonna say

00:01:06.727 --> 00:01:10.214
my passions.

00:01:10.214 --> 00:01:13.034
- My industriousness.

00:01:13.034 --> 00:01:15.623
You can call me a lot of things
but lazy is none of them.

00:01:15.623 --> 00:01:17.444
- I don't have enemies.

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:19.462
- [Man] What is happily ever after?

00:01:19.462 --> 00:01:21.704
- I am going to press

00:01:21.704 --> 00:01:24.202
the adventure continues.

00:01:24.202 --> 00:01:25.198
- I mean I've seen Into the Woods,

00:01:25.198 --> 00:01:26.925
there's no such thing
as happily ever after.

00:01:26.925 --> 00:01:28.277
Life just keeps going.

00:01:28.277 --> 00:01:31.004
There's no act two, there's no act three.

00:01:31.004 --> 00:01:32.882
You just keep evolving.

00:01:32.882 --> 00:01:34.031
Oh, there's one for that,

00:01:34.031 --> 00:01:34.925
the adventure continues.

00:01:34.925 --> 00:01:35.758
I'll click that.

00:01:35.758 --> 00:01:38.827
- The adventure continues.

00:01:38.827 --> 00:01:40.449
- You got Ariel.

00:01:40.449 --> 00:01:42.218
Girl, Under the Sea, let's go.

00:01:42.218 --> 00:01:45.144
- I got Ariel (claps), Brah!

00:01:45.144 --> 00:01:47.149
I knew I was gonna get Ariel.

00:01:47.149 --> 00:01:48.441
You are a dreamer who's always thinking

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:50.557
of the next big step in your life.

00:01:50.557 --> 00:01:52.275
Some may think you have
set your sights too high,

00:01:52.275 --> 00:01:55.515
but your friends know you
are capable of anything.

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:59.303
- Wow, I got Jasmine.

00:01:59.303 --> 00:02:03.625
Daring and adventurous, you
are considered the daredevil

00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:05.153
for your group.

00:02:05.153 --> 00:02:06.601
You enjoy having fun, taking risks,

00:02:06.601 --> 00:02:08.680
and living life to the fullest.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:12.619
You also are incredibly
handsome and you smell good.

00:02:12.619 --> 00:02:13.452
Nice.

00:02:13.452 --> 00:02:16.281
Here's the thing, I was
looking at these princesses

00:02:16.281 --> 00:02:17.372
and then I thought, you know what,

00:02:17.372 --> 00:02:21.247
I just, I gotta pick Jasmine
at the top of this thing,

00:02:21.247 --> 00:02:23.056
but then I thought wait, that's too cheesy

00:02:23.056 --> 00:02:24.379
because I'd be a doting dad

00:02:24.379 --> 00:02:26.129
because my daughter's name is Jasmine,

00:02:26.129 --> 00:02:27.164
so I'm not gonna do it.

00:02:27.164 --> 00:02:30.624
And then (snaps), as
such the universe works,

00:02:30.624 --> 00:02:32.534
I wound up being Jasmine,

00:02:32.534 --> 00:02:34.234
so I'm very happy about that.

00:02:34.234 --> 00:02:35.190
(laughing)

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:36.550
I love BuzzFeed, man.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.042
- [Women] We love you.

00:02:38.042 --> 00:02:39.914
- You guys are the best.

00:02:39.914 --> 00:02:42.187
Really, you guys are the best,
I always take your quizzes.

